2026-10-25T02:59:08.6034890Z [1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer[0m
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6530760Z [32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6555550Z [0m
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6557620Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6558360Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6560330Z 
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6561830Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6563230Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6564990Z 
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6566100Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6572050Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6580970Z 
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6581580Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [351..356])[0m and groups [34m(gid 350)[0m
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6582090Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6583160Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6583550Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6583790Z 
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6584010Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6584320Z 
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6584550Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6584930Z    can use Nix.
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6585120Z 
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6585270Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6585480Z 
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6585840Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6586320Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6588000Z 
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6588170Z I will:
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6588340Z 
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6588560Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6588920Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6589960Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6590710Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6591370Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6591670Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6592860Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6593240Z    /var/root
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6606570Z  - back up /etc/bashrc to /etc/bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6607490Z  - update /etc/bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6648430Z  - back up /etc/zshrc to /etc/zshrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6650660Z  - update /etc/zshrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6652210Z  - create a Nix volume and a LaunchDaemon to mount it
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6654820Z  - create a LaunchDaemon (at /Library/LaunchDaemons/org.nixos.nix-daemon.plist) for nix-daemon
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6655910Z 
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6656940Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-10-25T02:59:08.6657950Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
